        dcterms:source "Law 2 saturating two-face algebra (Lean theorem feugier_2005_winner_take_all_vs_saturating_bipolar) & Scarpella et al. (2006) Genes Dev. 20:1015-1027 bipolar PIN1 cells; NOT a result reported by Feugier et al. (2005), who find no branching for decelerating responses" ;
        schema:value "0.518" .

