        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1193-1400) returns 15 deterministic reference-anchored measurements: the 9 Pass 2 metrics (pool error 0.0, antisymmetry 0.0, dominant-face shares 0.9978/0.5221, Pearson r 0.9999, scaffold Betti-1 0/16, specimen Betti-1 205, compactness 0.7749) plus 6 new ones — Lockhart area fold change 2.399 (closed form 2.3989, Euler witness within 8.5e-5), sequential vein orders 4/4, open-tree final beta_1 = 0, committed final beta_1 = 4 (ref >= 1), decelerating vein-cell fraction 0.8575 (ref 1.0 +- 0.15), tau_commit Spearman rho = -1.0 — each with a k_1 = 0 negative control where applicable. Debits: 5 of the 6 new reference values come from the internally authored `growing_blade_reference.json`, the decelerating tolerance (+- 0.15) is loose, and the scaffold's dominant-face share, previously hard-coded, is now computed (L663-664) but still measured on a templated network." ;
